PLACEHOLDER: no Codemagic Patch signing key yet.

Replace this whole file with the PUBLIC half of Zekra's Patch release-signing
key (the PEM block that starts with a "BEGIN PUBLIC KEY" line). Until it holds
one, app.config.js leaves the Patch plugin out and OTA updates stay off, even
when PATCH_* deployment keys are set. The private key never goes in the repo:
it is CODEMAGIC_PATCH_PRIVATE_KEY (base64) in Codemagic's zekra_patch group.
Steps: mobile/README.md -> "OTA updates (Codemagic Patch)".
